      "speaker_title": "",
      "reviewed": true,
      "text": "THE HERITAGE AND MUSEUMS BILL (SENATE BILLS NO.22 OF 2021)"
    },
    {
      "order": 18,
      "id": "entry-1145140",
      "label": "speech",
      "level": "3",
      "cutout": false,
      "original_label": "",
      "speaker": "John Kinyua Nderitu",
      "speaker_title": "(The Temporary Chairperson)",
      "reviewed": true,
      "text": "Hon. Senators, we are in the Committee of the Whole for Order Nos. 8, 9, 10, and 11 for Division. I would like the Whips to confirm the numbers. As they do so, let the Division Bell be rung for 10 minutes."
    },
    {
      "order": 19,
      "id": "entry-1145141",
      "label": "scene",
      "level": "3",
      "cutout": false,
      "original_label": "",
      "speaker": "",
      "speaker_title": "",
      "reviewed": true,
      "text": "(The Division Bell was rung)"
    },
    {
      "order": 20,
      "id": "entry-1145142",
      "label": "speech",
      "level": "3",
      "cutout": false,
      "original_label": "",
      "speaker": "John Kinyua Nderitu",
      "speaker_title": "(The Temporary Chairperson)",
      "reviewed": true,
      "text": "I order that the Division Bell to be rung for another five minutes."
    },
    {
      "order": 21,
      "id": "entry-1145143",
      "label": "scene",
      "level": "3",
      "cutout": false,
      "original_label": "",
      "speaker": "",
      "speaker_title": "",
      "reviewed": true,
      "text": "(The Division Bell was rung)"
    },
    {
      "order": 22,
      "id": "entry-1145145",
      "label": "speech",
      "level": "3",
      "cutout": false,
      "original_label": "",
      "speaker": "John Kinyua Nderitu",
      "speaker_title": "(The Temporary Chairperson)",
      "reviewed": true,
      "text": "Order, Senators. We will not progress to Division because we do not have the requisite numbers. Therefore, I call upon the Mover to report progress."
    },
    {
      "order": 23,
      "id": "entry-1145146",
      "label": "speech",
      "level": "3",
      "cutout": false,
      "original_label": "",
      "speaker": "Milgo Alice Chepkorir",
      "speaker_title": "",
      "reviewed": true,
      "text": "Mr. Temporary Chairperson, Sir, pursuant to Standing Order No.148, I beg to move that the Committee of the Whole do report progress of its consideration of The Heritage and Museum Bill (Senate Bills No.22 of 2021) and seek leave to sit again tomorrow. I thank you."
    },
    {
      "order": 24,
      "id": "entry-1145148-parenthesis-split-1-of-4",
