      "speaker_title": "(The Temporary Speaker)",
      "reviewed": true,
      "text": "Hon. Senators, having deferred some of the business on the Order Paper, it is now time to adjourn the House. The Senate, therefore, stands adjourned until Tuesday 8th February, 2022, at 2:30 p.m.\n\nThe Senate rose at 3.07 p.m."
